# results/ is committed on purpose: the numbers are properties of the mathematics,
# not of the machine, so a clone should reproduce every one of them. Two caveats,
# so nobody wastes time on a diff: the wall-clock lines obviously vary, and the
# threaded reduction sums in a different order, so agreement is to the precision
# printed and not bit-for-bit.
